<title>LATVIA: LIEPAJA METALURGS SHARE AUCTION COMPLETE.</title>
<headline>LIEPAJA METALURGS SHARE AUCTION COMPLETE.</headline>
<dateline>RIGA 1997-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Riga Stock Exchange said on Monday the Liepaja Metalurgs metal plant share auction for privatisation vouchers was successful, according to unofficial results, with all shares on offer sold.</p>
<p>The number of shares on offer was 993,207 and the auction price came to 20.49 lats.</p>
<p>The auction results still have to be confirmed by the Latvian Privatisation Agency.</p>
<p>-- Martinsh Gravitis, Riga Newsroom +371 721 5240</p>
